#: sw/apps/text/text.c:4075
#, c-format
msgid ""
"A plain text editor for notes, lists and Markdown.\n"
"\n"
"Ctrl+N/O/S\tNew, open, save\n"
"Ctrl+Shift+S\tSave as\n"
"Ctrl+Q\tClose\n"
"Ctrl+C/X/V\tCopy, cut, paste\n"
"Ctrl+A\tSelect all\n"
"Ctrl+Z/Y\tUndo, redo\n"
"Ctrl+F, F3\tFind, find again\n"
"Ctrl+H\tReplace\n"
"Ctrl+L\tGo to line; counts words\n"
"Ctrl+P\tPrint, or print to a PDF\n"
"\n"
"Shift with the arrows, or a drag, selects. A .docx, .odt or .rtf opens converted, as Markdown in %s (the RAM disk): Save puts it in %s."
msgstr ""

